&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Go To Market Recruiter to serve as a strategic talent architect for our high-performing commercial organisation. Partnering directly with our Germany &amp;amp; Austria Country Manager and Sales Regional Leaders, you will own the full-cycle execution of our most critical commercial hires, collaborating closely with cross-functional people teams. Your mission is to systematically solve regional talent constraints and engineer a world-class candidate journey.&lt;/p&gt;
