&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Advisory &amp;amp; Data Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to influence senior stakeholders by leveraging market intelligence and funnel analytics to diagnose bottlenecks, shape hiring decisions, and set regional priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Sourcing &amp;amp; Closing:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert knowledge of multi-channel sourcing strategies to build high-quality pipelines, coupled with a strong history of navigating complex sales compensation models through to successful close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Discipline &amp;amp; Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing multiple high-bar sales requisitions simultaneously utilizing structured interview architectures and skills-based evaluation rubrics, without compromising the candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
