&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with key stakeholders in marketing and across the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the framework and gather market data to assist in launching net new positions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
