&lt;p data-start=&quot;209&quot; data-end=&quot;293&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;209&quot; data-end=&quot;293&quot;&gt;Schedule: All Shifts, Weekday, Weekends, and Overnights available!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;209&quot; data-end=&quot;293&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/DxScXOg6sdY?si=vHjLRv7mEZHa7IEW&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;340&quot; data-end=&quot;373&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;340&quot; data-end=&quot;373&quot;&gt;Be the difference. Be BAYADA.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;375&quot; data-end=&quot;715&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking a compassionate and dependable Certified Home Health Aide to provide one on one care for a client living in Franklin Township. This role offers consistent weekend afternoon hours and the opportunity to build a meaningful connection while helping a client remain safe, comfortable, and independent at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;717&quot; data-end=&quot;825&quot;&gt;Weekend availability is highly valued, with opportunities to expand your schedule based on your preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;849&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;• Provide personal care and assistance with daily living activities&lt;br data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;• Support the client’s safety, comfort, and mobility in the home&lt;br data-start=&quot;983&quot; data-end=&quot;986&quot;&gt;• Follow an individualized care plan and observe changes in condition&lt;br data-start=&quot;1055&quot; data-end=&quot;1058&quot;&gt;• Communicate professionally with BAYADA’s clinical and office teams&lt;br data-start=&quot;1126&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;• Create a positive, respectful, and supportive care environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1197&quot; data-end=&quot;1224&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1197&quot; data-end=&quot;1224&quot;&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1226&quot; data-end=&quot;1529&quot;&gt;• Active New Jersey Home Health Aide certification&lt;br data-start=&quot;1276&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;• Availability to work one or both weekend days from 12 PM to 5 PM&lt;br data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;• Reliable, professional, and committed to consistent care&lt;br data-start=&quot;1406&quot; data-end=&quot;1409&quot;&gt;• Compassionate and patient centered approach&lt;br data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;• Experience with personal care and transfers, or willingness to learn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1572&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1572&quot;&gt;Why You Will Love Working With BAYADA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1574&quot; data-end=&quot;1852&quot;&gt;• Competitive pay with predictable scheduling&lt;br data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1622&quot;&gt;• One on one care so you can focus on your client&lt;br data-start=&quot;1671&quot; data-end=&quot;1674&quot;&gt;• Paid training and ongoing clinical support&lt;br data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;• Flexible scheduling with access to additional cases&lt;br data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1777&quot;&gt;• A trusted organization built on Compassion, Excellence, and Reliability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1854&quot; data-end=&quot;2049&quot;&gt;At BAYADA, our caregivers are the heart of everything we do. If you are looking for meaningful work where you are valued, supported, and empowered to make a difference, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2129&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2129&quot;&gt;Join BAYADA and serve your local Franklin Township community. Apply today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA is celebrating 50 years of compassion, excellence, and reliability. Learn more about our 50th anniversary celebration and how you can join in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/50&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care, Inc., and its associated entities and joint venture partners, are Equal Opportunity Employers. All employment decisions are made on a non-discriminatory basis without regard to sex, race, color, age, disability, pregnancy or maternity, sexual orientation, gender identity, citizenship status, military status, or any other similarly protected status in accordance with federal, state and local laws. &amp;nbsp;Hence, we strongly encourage applications from people with these identities or who are members of other marginalized communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

